    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It features a randomly generated, vast map, offering unique challenges and exploration opportunities each time.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/ee224bb72949ae8549fbe56f1b0a7f37.poster.avif?t=1753784314\" width=616 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/ee224bb72949ae8549fbe56f1b0a7f37.webm?t=1753784314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/ee224bb72949ae8549fbe56f1b0a7f37.mp4?t=1753784314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every human has a distinct personality that evolves based on the player's choices, showcasing diverse growth paths.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/fe88d462bf5b4866da5affd4d034dc91.poster.avif?t=1753784314\" width=616 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/fe88d462bf5b4866da5affd4d034dc91.webm?t=1753784314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/fe88d462bf5b4866da5affd4d034dc91.mp4?t=1753784314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can choose to either observe the natural development of civilization or intervene and guide its progress using divine powers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/87617f84793c9ca6ea64b9aad70ce677.poster.avif?t=1753784314\" width=616 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/87617f84793c9ca6ea64b9aad70ce677.webm?t=1753784314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/87617f84793c9ca6ea64b9aad70ce677.mp4?t=1753784314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are nine gods, each with unique abilities, and players can freely combine and choose four gods for each playthrough, allowing for endless strategic possibilities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/ffe50bbd2dfde301230ae2765e0abc4c.poster.avif?t=1753784314\" width=616 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/ffe50bbd2dfde301230ae2765e0abc4c.webm?t=1753784314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/ffe50bbd2dfde301230ae2765e0abc4c.mp4?t=1753784314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The threat of heretical beliefs can disrupt the course of civilization, and players must lead humanity toward devout faith to maintain order.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/092125976af2cf4fcf38ac5731702509.poster.avif?t=1753784314\" width=616 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/092125976af2cf4fcf38ac5731702509.webm?t=1753784314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/092125976af2cf4fcf38ac5731702509.mp4?t=1753784314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over 189 skill combinations, the game offers a rich array of strategic choices, ensuring a varied and engaging gameplay experience every time.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It features a randomly generated, vast map, offering unique challenges and exploration opportunities each time.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/ee224bb72949ae8549fbe56f1b0a7f37.poster.avif?t=1753784314\" width=616 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/ee224bb72949ae8549fbe56f1b0a7f37.webm?t=1753784314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/ee224bb72949ae8549fbe56f1b0a7f37.mp4?t=1753784314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every human has a distinct personality that evolves based on the player's choices, showcasing diverse growth paths.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/fe88d462bf5b4866da5affd4d034dc91.poster.avif?t=1753784314\" width=616 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/fe88d462bf5b4866da5affd4d034dc91.webm?t=1753784314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/fe88d462bf5b4866da5affd4d034dc91.mp4?t=1753784314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can choose to either observe the natural development of civilization or intervene and guide its progress using divine powers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/87617f84793c9ca6ea64b9aad70ce677.poster.avif?t=1753784314\" width=616 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/87617f84793c9ca6ea64b9aad70ce677.webm?t=1753784314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/87617f84793c9ca6ea64b9aad70ce677.mp4?t=1753784314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are nine gods, each with unique abilities, and players can freely combine and choose four gods for each playthrough, allowing for endless strategic possibilities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/ffe50bbd2dfde301230ae2765e0abc4c.poster.avif?t=1753784314\" width=616 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/ffe50bbd2dfde301230ae2765e0abc4c.webm?t=1753784314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/ffe50bbd2dfde301230ae2765e0abc4c.mp4?t=1753784314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The threat of heretical beliefs can disrupt the course of civilization, and players must lead humanity toward devout faith to maintain order.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/092125976af2cf4fcf38ac5731702509.poster.avif?t=1753784314\" width=616 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/092125976af2cf4fcf38ac5731702509.webm?t=1753784314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/092125976af2cf4fcf38ac5731702509.mp4?t=1753784314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over 189 skill combinations, the game offers a rich array of strategic choices, ensuring a varied and engaging gameplay experience every time.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Pandora's Toybox combines god simulation and Roguelike elements. Players guide humanity from settlements to city-states, shaping a faith-driven civilization. As Epimetheus, use divine powers to combat heretical beliefs and build a thriving, devout society in a randomly generated, chaotic world.",
